                                "sense_id": "d6643e61-9850-3217-8a81-3d789caedcc8",
                                "text": "Rags was on the wrong side of a ruck in a training exercise and Woody gave him a shoeing, just as you would to one of the opposition in a match situation."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "413bcb8b-9fff-446d-a06c-3f8d53a6d02b",
                                "sense_id": "d6643e61-9850-3217-8a81-3d789caedcc8",
                                "text": "They jump the two babyface performers and give them a shoeing, only to get cleared out of the ring in double quick time."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "38442958-57cd-4bf0-b4f5-0de62ccb9e09",
                                "sense_id": "d6643e61-9850-3217-8a81-3d789caedcc8",
                                "text": "And he gave the IRA a right shoeing as well."
                            }
                        ]
